#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Zamieszki były brutalne, jeszcze zanim martwi powstali i zaczęli pożerać "
"żywych. Kordon, który utrzymywałeś, został przerwany. Tylko dzięki odrobinie "
"szczęścia i solidnemu obijaniu łbów wyszedłeś z tego cało, a najgorsze "
"dopiero przed tobą."

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Zamieszki były brutalne, jeszcze zanim martwi powstali i zaczęli pożerać "
"żywych. Kordon, który utrzymywałaś, został przerwany. Tylko dzięki odrobinie "
"szczęścia i solidnemu obijaniu łbów wyszłaś z tego cało, a najgorsze dopiero "
"przed tobą."

#. ~ Description of profession "Modern Archer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the "
"latest trends in archery.  You always tried to keep up with the times, "
"acquiring a takedown bow as well as several accessories to complement it.  "
"You can only hope all the training you did with them can help you survive in "
"this trying times."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś wielkim miłośnikiem dawnych łuczników, ale zarazem śledzisz najnowsze "
"trendy w łucznictwie. Zawsze starałeś się iść z duchem czasu, kupując łuk z "
"odłączanymi ramionami i kilka akcesoriów do niego. Możesz tylko mieć "
"nadzieję, że wszystkie treningi z tym sprzętem pomogą ci przetrwać te trudne "
"czasy."

#. ~ Description of profession "Modern Archer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the "
