"wypłyniesz na otwarty ocean?"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You did the wet work for a gang, mafia, or whatever person had enough money."
"  You were no trained assassin, but you know how to shoot a gun and get out "
"of dodge quickly."
msgstr ""
"Wykonywałeś mokrą robotę dla gangu, mafii albo kogokolwiek, kto miał dość "
"pieniędzy. Nie byłeś wyszkolonym zabójcą, ale umiesz strzelać i szybko się "
"ulotnić."

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitwoman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
